      "note": [
        ".. = not presented (outside of the top 10 and the top 100 names).",
        "Different spellings are included in each name and the name is presented with the most common spelling variant in the entire population.",
        "Includes all first names that were found among the 100 most common names among registered persons by sex on 31 December of each year, excluding persons with protected identities.",
        "The break in the time series between 2007 and 2008 is because double names without a hyphen, for example Britt Marie and Lars Erik, up to and including 2007 were counted as two first names, while from 2008 onwards these are counted as one first name if the code for name normally used says that both names are normally used."
